## Pattern 1 — Print the canvas position of every node in the active glyph

```python
from PythonQt.QtCore import QPointF
import fontlab as fl

canvas = fl.flWorkspace.instance().currentCanvas
gi = canvas.activeGlyphInfo() if canvas else None
if gi:
    for ci in gi.getNearbyContours(QPointF(0,0), 99999, ""):
        for ni in ci.getNodesInfo():
            cp = ni.getMappedPoint()
            gp = ni.getGlyphPoint(True)
            print(f"  Glyph ({gp.x():.0f}, {gp.y():.0f}) → Canvas ({cp.x():.0f}, {cp.y():.0f})")
```

## Pattern 2 — Nudge all selected nodes up by one unit

```python
from PythonQt.QtCore import QPointF
import fontlab as fl

canvas = fl.flWorkspace.instance().currentCanvas
if canvas:
    for ni in canvas.selectedNodes():
        p = ni.getGlyphPoint(False)
        ni.setGlyphPoint(QPointF(p.x(), p.y() + 1))
    fl.Update()
```

