```python
import fontlab as fl

font = fl.CurrentFont()
wght = next((a for a in font.axes if a.tag == "wght"), None)
if wght:
    print(f"Weight axis: {wght.minimal}–{wght.maximum}  default={wght.default}")
```

### Check whether the font is a variable font

```python
import fontlab as fl

font = fl.CurrentFont()
if font.axes:
    print(f"Variable font with {len(font.axes)} axis/axes: "
          + ", ".join(a.tag for a in font.axes))
else:
    print("Static font (no axes).")
```

